# Day 02 — Services & Tags

## 🔹 Ansible — Install & Enable Nginx

---
- name : Install and Start Nginx on Pathnex
  hosts : all
  become: yes

  tasks: 
    - name: Install nginx
      yum:
        name: nginx
        state: present

    - name: Enable nginx
      service:
        name: nginx
        state: present
    
    - name Enable nginx
      service:
        name:nginx
        state: started
        enabled: yes


